4. src/css/Notifications.css
============================================================
Added the responsive dark styling for the page, unread rows, errors, and empty/loading states.

```css
.notifications-page {
  width: min(100%, 820px);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 34px 28px 48px;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.notifications-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.notifications-eyebrow {
  margin: 0 0 7px;
  color: #60a5fa;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.notifications-header h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
  font-size: 28px;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.notifications-subtitle {
  margin: 7px 0 0;
  color: var(--gray-neutral);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.notifications-read-button {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  color: var(--ink);
  background: #18181b;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  border-radius: 7px;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.notifications-read-button:hover:not(:disabled) {
  border-color: var(--blue-primary);
}

.notifications-read-button:disabled {
  color: #77777f;
  cursor: default;
}

.notifications-read-button:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--blue-primary);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.notifications-error {
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  color: #ff8295;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.notifications-list {
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #151518;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  border-radius: 11px;
}

.notification-row {
  min-height: 76px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 13px;
  padding: 13px 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
}

.notification-row:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.notification-unread {
  background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.09);
}

.notification-avatar {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  flex: 0 0 42px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: #fff;
  background: #2563eb;
  border-radius: 50%;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.notification-message {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  margin: 0;
  color: #d4d4d8;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.notification-message strong {
  color: #fafafa;
}

.notification-time {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--gray-neutral);
  font-size: 11px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.notification-unread-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  flex: 0 0 8px;
  background: #3b82f6;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.notifications-empty {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 38px 20px;
  color: var(--gray-neutral);
  font-size: 13px;
  text-align: center;
}

@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .notifications-page {
    padding: 24px 16px 36px;
  }

  .notifications-header {
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .notifications-header h1 {
    font-size: 24px;
  }

  .notification-row {
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px;
  }

  .notification-time {
    font-size: 10px;
  }
}
```

